  "description": "Swordmaster Taria was the most powerful person in Middle-Earth, where humans and fairies live, and the leader of the knights.  \nTaria joins his subordinates and colleagues in a reckless operation to eliminate Kai'z, the king of the demon world who invaded Middle-earth, but after losing them all,  \nHe commits suicide and meets his end along with Kaizu. But it wasn't the end.  \n100 years later, signs of the Demon God's second coming began again. and,\n\n“I’m alive?”\n\nTaria's fight begins again when she returns to the world 100 years later.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63285913), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10708029)",
